iv class=\"cv-dialog__panel\" data-bl-s=\"\"><div class=\"cv-dialog__header\"><h2 id=\"_R_2dinebn5rlknelb_\" class=\"cv-dialog__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Menu</span></h2><button type=\"button\" class=\"cv-btn cv-btn--ghost cv-dialog__close\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Close</span></button></div><div class=\"cv-dialog__body\"><ul class=\"cv-menu__list\"><li><a class=\"cv-menu__link\" href=\"/guests\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Guest Portal</span></span></a></li><li><a class=\"cv-menu__link\" href=\"/guests/travel\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Travel</span></span></a></li><li><a class=\"cv-menu__link\" href=\"/guests/things-to-do\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Things to Do</span></span></a></li><li><a class=\"cv-menu__link\" href=\"/guests/ask-us\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Ask Us</span></span></a></li><li><div class=\"account-menu account-menu--inline\" role=\"group\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_2nmdinebn5rlknelb_\"><p id=\"_R_2nmdinebn5rlknelb_\" class=\"account-menu__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Your account</span></p><ul class=\"account-menu__list\"><li><a class=\"cv-menu__link\" href=\"/photos\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Photos &amp; Video</span></a></li><li><a class=\"cv-menu__link\" href=\"/sign-out\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Sign out</span></a></li></ul></div></li></ul></div></div></dialog></div></header><main id=\"main\" class=\"cv-main\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-bl-k=\"main\" data-bl-label=\"Getting to Chicago\"><header class=\"cv-pagehead\" data-bl-k=\"header\" data-bl-label=\"Getting to Chicago\"><p class=\"cv-pagehead__tag\"><span class=\"cv-specimen cv-specimen--static\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Travel &amp; Stay</span></span></p><h1 class=\"cv-h cv-h--1 cv-pagehead__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Getting to Chicago</span></h1><p class=\"cv-lede\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We know many of you will be traveling to join us, and we’re grateful you’re making the trip. Here’s some helpful information to make planning your stay a little easier. We’ll add more details as our plans come together.</span></p></header><section id=\"arriving\" class=\"cv-section cv-section--default\" aria-labelledby=\"arriving-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Getting to Chicago\"><hr class=\"cv-fern\" data-bl-s=\"\"><div class=\"cv-section__grid\"><div class=\"cv-section__head\"><h2 id=\"arriving-title\" class=\"cv-h cv-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Getting to Chicago</span></h2></div><div class=\"cv-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We recommend flying into O'Hare (ORD). There is no wedding shuttle; take the CTA Blue Line “L” train into downtown. Visit the</span><!-- --> <a class=\"cv-link\" href=\"https://www.transitchicago.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chicago Transit Authority</span><svg class=\"cv-external\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M14 4h6v6M20 4l-9 9M18 13v7H4V6h7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">, opens in a new tab</span></span></a><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> for routes and service information.</span></p><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Rideshare pickup details at the airport are coming soon. Uber can take you from the airport to the hotel.</span></p><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Midway (MDW) also serves Chicago with trains, taxis, and rideshare into downtown.</span></p><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">By train: </span><a class=\"cv-link\" href=\"https://www.amtrak.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Amtrak</span><svg class=\"cv-external\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M14 4h6v6M20 4l-9 9M18 13v7H4V6h7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">, opens in a new tab</span></span></a><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> serves Chicago's Union Station from cities throughout the country.</span></p><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">By car: valet parking is $84 per night with in-and-out privileges at the 71 E Madison entrance. Millennium Park Garage (6 S. Columbus Dr.) and Millennium Lakeside Garage (5 S. Columbus Dr.) are nearby alternatives. Check </span><a class=\"cv-link\" href=\"https://www.millenniumgarages.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Millennium Garages</span><svg class=\"cv-external\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M14 4h6v6M20 4l-9 9M18 13v7H4V6h7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">, opens in a new tab</span></span></a><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> for current rates and reservations. Parking rates and availability may change before the wedding.</span></p><p><a class=\"cv-link cv-link--standalone\" href=\"/trip\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Your guest travel details and weekend plans →</span></a></p></div></div></section><section id=\"airports\" class=\"cv-section cv-section--default\" aria-labelledby=\"airports-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Two airports serve Chicago\"><hr class=\"cv-fern\" data-bl-s=\"\"><div class=\"cv-section__grid\"><div class=\"cv-section__head\"><h2 id=\"airports-title\" class=\"cv-h cv-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Two airports serve Chicago</span></h2></div><div class=\"cv-travel__airports\"><article class=\"cv-card\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"ORD\"><span class=\"cv-specimen\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">O'Hare International Airport</span></span><h3 class=\"cv-card__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">ORD</span></h3><div class=\"cv-card__body\"><div class=\"cv-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We recommend flying into O’Hare. There is no wedding shuttle; take the CTA Blue Line “L” train into downtown. Rideshare pickup details are coming soon; Uber can take you from the airport to the hotel.</span></p></div></div></article><article class=\"cv-card\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"MDW\"><span class=\"cv-specimen\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chicago Midway International Airport</span></span><h3 class=\"cv-card__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">MDW</span></h3><div class=\"cv-card__body\"><div class=\"cv-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Midway also serves Chicago with trains, taxis, and rideshare into downtown.</span></p></div></div></article></div></div></section><section id=\"stay\" class=\"cv-section cv-section--wash\" aria-labelledby=\"stay-title\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Where to stay\"><hr class=\"cv-fern\" data-bl-s=\"\"><div class=\"cv-section__grid\"><div class=\"cv-section__head\"><h2 id=\"stay-title\" class=\"cv-h cv-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Where to stay</span></h2></div><article class=\"cv-card cv-pressed\" data-flower=\"a\" style=\"--i:0\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"Chicago Athletic Association Hotel\"><span class=\"cv-specimen\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Where the day happens</span></span><h3 class=\"cv-card__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Chicago Athletic Association Hotel</span></h3><div class=\"cv-card__body\"><div class=\"cv-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The wedding is here, so staying here means no travel on the day.</span></p><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Call 844-312-2221 to book with group code G-FIKE.</span></p></div><dl class=\"cv-stats\"><div class=\"cv-stat\"><dt class=\"cv-stat__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Group rate</span></dt><dd class=\"cv-stat__value\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">$331–371/night</span></dd></div><div class=\"cv-stat\"><dt class=\"cv-stat__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Book by</span></dt><dd class=\"cv-stat__value\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Tuesday, June 15, 2027</span></dd></div><div class=\"cv-stat\"><dt class=\"cv-stat__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Block dates</span></dt><dd class=\"cv-stat__value\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Friday, July 16, 2027 to Sunday, July 18, 2027</span></dd></div><div class=\"cv-stat\"><dt class=\"cv-stat__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Booking code</span></dt><dd class=\"cv-stat__value\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">G-FIKE</span></dd></div></dl><div class=\"cv-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">If you are interested in an upgraded room or an extended stay, please let us know.</span></p></div><p><a class=\"cv-link cv-link--standalone\" href=\"https://www.chicagoathletichotel.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Visit the hotel website</span><svg class=\"cv-external\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M14 4h6v6M20 4l-9 9M18 13v7H4V6h7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">, opens in a new tab</span></span></a></p></div></article><div class=\"cv-section__head\"><h3 class=\"cv-h cv-h--3\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Nearby, hand-picked</span></h3></div><div class=\"cv-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We are still confirming a few nearby options at different prices.</span><!-- --> <span class=\"todo\" role=\"note\" data-placeholder=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span class=\"todo__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this</span><!-- --><span d